{"id":"pueblo","lemma":"pueblo","pos":"noun","rank":392,"glosses":["town, village","the common people, the working classes","population, people"],"ipa":"/ˈpweblo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pueblos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-pueblo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom dejó el pueblo.","en":"Tom left town.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734850"},{"text":"El autobús paró en todos los pueblos.","en":"The bus stopped in every village.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/34525"},{"text":"¿A cuánto está el pueblo?","en":"How far is it to town?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611281"},{"text":"Los pueblos luchan por su libertad.","en":"Nations are fighting for freedom."},{"text":"Ella vive en el pueblo.","en":"She lives in the village.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/552797"}]}